# The packed template is one base64 string literal half a megabyte long: a
# textual diff of it is the whole line, twice, and says nothing a reader can use
# — a version bump's commit was 99.7% base64. `-diff` shows it as "Binary files
# differ" in `git diff`/`git show`/`git log -p`; it stays a text file for
# checkout, so the root file's `eol=lf` still holds.
#
# Here and not in the root .gitattributes, because that one is packed into the
# template and would ship this rule into every project `frx create` makes.
lib/src/template/template.g.dart -diff
